      "text": "INVARIANT\n  STATE_FILE present   \u21d4   awww-daemon + listener + cache live\n  STATE_FILE absent    \u21d4   swaybg alone (Omarchy default autostart)\nEvery entry point (toggle / startup / rebuild) reconciles to this invariant.",
      "fontSize": 18.2,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "originalText": "INVARIANT\n  STATE_FILE present   \u21d4   awww-daemon + listener + cache live\n  STATE_FILE absent    \u21d4   swaybg alone (Omarchy default autostart)\nEvery entry point (toggle / startup / rebuild) reconciles to this invariant.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "autoResize": true
    },
