      "updated": 1776361641351,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Omarchy defaults (ship with base install)\n  bash                   script shell\n  hyprctl                Hyprland IPC client\n  swaybg                 fallback wallpaper daemon (feature OFF)\n  uwsm-app               session-managed process launch\n  notify-send            user notifications (libnotify + mako)\n  jq                     JSON parsing of hyprctl output\n  coreutils / util-linux sed, awk, grep, find, sort, cut,\n                         printf, cat, tr, setsid\n  procps                 pkill (daemon lifecycle)",
      "fontSize": 16.900000000000002,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "originalText": "Omarchy defaults (ship with base install)\n  bash                   script shell\n  hyprctl                Hyprland IPC client\n  swaybg                 fallback wallpaper daemon (feature OFF)\n  uwsm-app               session-managed process launch\n  notify-send            user notifications (libnotify + mako)\n  jq                     JSON parsing of hyprctl output\n  coreutils / util-linux sed, awk, grep, find, sort, cut,\n                         printf, cat, tr, setsid\n  procps                 pkill (daemon lifecycle)",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "autoResize": true
    },
